                                                "sense_id": "132c08df-7214-31bb-b574-2e589955176c",
                                                "text": "The top six are assured of continental competition and after making a statement of intent against Stoke, it would take a dramatic collapse for Newcastle to surrender their place."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd9a1f9c-8481-476b-9d4f-390e44202231",
                                                "sense_id": "132c08df-7214-31bb-b574-2e589955176c",
                                                "text": "England delivered an impressive statement of intent in the Rugby World Cup opener by scorching to a 69-7 victory against the United States in front of a record crowd of 42,723 in Sunderland."
                                            }
